    <section id="about" class="border-t border-line py-24 sm:py-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_320px] md:gap-20">
          <div class="reveal relative isolate mx-auto w-56 md:order-last md:w-full">
            <div aria-hidden="true" class="glow absolute -inset-16 -z-10 opacity-70"></div>
            <Image src={thomas} alt="Thomas Beckford" width={640} class="w-full -rotate-2 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl shadow-black/60 ring-1 ring-line" />
            <span class="sticker">That's me</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="h2 reveal">You deal with me. <span class="text-muted">Not an agency, not a call centre.</span></h2>
            <p class="reveal mt-5 max-w-xl text-pretty text-muted">I'm Thomas, a software and AI engineer in London. For {site.years} years I've built booking systems for venue chains and apps with thousands of users. Your website gets that same care, at a local-business price.</p>
            <p class="reveal mt-4 max-w-xl text-pretty text-muted">One person from your first message to a live site, and after. You message me, I answer.</p>
            <div class="reveal mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-sm">
              <span class="text-muted">Built for</span>
